<title>WEST INDIES: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 147 AND 124-2 V SRI LANKA (222) - LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 147 AND 124-2 V SRI LANKA (222) - LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies, 75</p>
<p>behind on first innings, were 124 for two in their second</p>
<p>innings at lunch on the third day of the second test against Sri</p>
<p>Lanka at Arnos Vale on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 147 and 124-2, Sri Lanka 222.</p>
</text>
